{
  "harness": 1,
  "name": "kit-ui.kit",
  "about": "LumaKit ui.kit (lumakit.md 2.20, lumakit-modules.md row 16): J's kit-ui.kit opens a pausing panel of a button, a slider 0..10 at 5, a toggle, a colour, a list of three and a text field, and writes a cue every 20 frames; this test gives one input a cue. each_widget (pad): A presses the button once; RIGHT moves the slider a twentieth (5.5); A flips the toggle on; RIGHT steps the colour to the palette's second (#FF4040); the list's row 1 is taken; text_field_keyboard: A opens the platform keyboard, 'Luma' is typed and confirmed (the harness's text step), on_done gets it. wheel_item: the second panel's wheel turned once and taken: entry 1. mod_off: the mod taken out with a pausing panel open: kit-screen-b reads 0 holders of the world (the panel closed and let go). Pointer and touch on each widget are by person until the panel's row places are facts (the mouse on a stop focuses it: kit.lum's stop_under). WAITING: input.text_request as pending<text?> and its handle (K), draw.view for ModelView (FB, written), input's press of a mod action for touch_layout (was F's).",
